raea's Bevy skills library (void/prompts/craft/bevy.md and bevy/*.md, mirrored in skills/raea-bevy/) is written for
@raea/motion/3d. No text was copied from other packs. Its layout (a short router, one file per topic, each with a
checked example and a list of common mistakes) follows EnzeD/r3f-skills (no license stated; cited, not copied),
chrisgliddon/bevy-skills (MIT) and gamedev-skills' bevy-ecs (Apache-2.0). Bevy API facts come from Bevy's own v0.19.1
examples and migration guides (MIT OR Apache-2.0). The survey with links is in motion/docs/bevy-coverage.md.
